# The versioning stage passes a raw value through unstamped.
MODULE: StampedWhenVersionedRawNotStamped
TARGET: StampedWhenVersioned
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a raw write to a versioned tree is stored without an envelope
PERTURBS: RunVersioning

--- FIND
       THEN /\ Advance(Env(val.body, "Target"))
--- REPLACE
       THEN /\ Advance(val)
--- END
